+is fresh and valid but carries `readiness == "unhealthy"`. `government/branch-liveness.sh:99-106` writes
+that value only when the branch cycle was not accepted, the agent status was unreadable after bounded
+re-probes, or the agent state was outside `running|idle|clearexit`. This is a **branch-readiness
+observation**, not a finding about delivered work, and its own file carries
+`caveat: "readiness_not_proof_of_agent_progress_or_completed_work"`.
